<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SecureMessenger | Sovereign E2EE Chat</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-black: #000000;
            --ghost-dark-green: #004D00;
            --ghost-neon-green: #27AE60;
            --ghost-white: #FFFFFF;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-black);
            color: var(--ghost-white);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--ghost-dark-green), var(--bg-black));
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 120px;
            height: auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--ghost-neon-green));
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.3);
        }

        .hero-section {
            text-align: center;
            border: none;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-size: 2.5em;
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ghost-dark-green);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .protocol-box {
            background-color: var(--ghost-dark-green);
            padding: 25px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);
        }

        .support-section {
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(0, 77, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .bear-img {
            max-width: 180px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #555;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <img src="glass_logo.png" alt="SecureMessenger Logo" class="logo">
        <h1>SecureMessenger</h1>
        <p>Built by One. Powered by You.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <section class="hero-section">
            <h2>The Ghost Protocol</h2>
            <p>Welcome to the era of <span class="highlight">Physical Sovereignty</span>. SecureMessenger is not just another app—it is a blind relay architecture designed to ensure that your identity and your data remain your own property.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="protocol-box">
            <h2>Why "Ghost"?</h2>
            <p>Our unique <b>GHOST Protocol</b> means that once your messages are delivered, they vanish from the network. We use hardware-backed encryption keys that never leave your device. On our servers, you are not a name or a phone number—you are a temporary routing hash.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Zero Metadata Harvesting</li>
                <li>Anonymous Routing IDs</li>
                <li>Forensic-Grade Local Deletion</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="support-section">
            <img src="bear_panic.png" alt="Support dQuantumBear" class="bear-img">
            <h2>Built by One, Powered by You</h2>
            <p>SecureMessenger is a project developed by <b>one (1) individual</b> with zero (0) support from Big Tech or billionaire funding. I have zero (0) interest in your data—only one (1) interest in Your Privacy.</p>
            <p>This code is powered by Honey and Honey only. The Jar is thankful and so am I!!!</p>
            <p class="highlight">— dQuantumBear</p>
        </section>

    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 SecureMessenger Project. Sovereign Build v7.6
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
